		(uuid "27c0eef2-f98d-424b-8768-3943be0e65cc")
	)
	(text "39SF010 (128K) fitted as standard.\nBoth switches on allow the full\n128K to be used, or treat as \n4 x 32K sections for alternative \nfiling systems.\n39SF010 only goes up to A16."
